{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model combining the scvi_n200 RNA encoder with the imagenet_vit_l image encoder in a multiprofile setup, using avgpool aggregation and concat fusion. The validation accuracy of 0.7150 and F1 of 0.6872 exceed the RNA-only scvi_n200 baseline (0.6501 accuracy, 0.6275 F1), suggesting potential benefits from the stronger image encoder. However, the exact contribution of the image encoder versus other design choices remains uncertain due to limited comparative isolation of variables."
}

